From 3510b39a71afd587c8076fd3ddd18a1ccbd23818 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Reuter <dreuter14@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 20:25:49 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Add TC_DOT AIR chip, RiscvAir registration, artifacts,
 and soundness tests

One row per 16-element fp8 tile step: fp8 decode, exact significand
products, two GroupSum stages (max-exponent selection, one-hot truncating
alignment shifts, signed 30-bit sum, truncating normalization), fp32 pack.
All shift/truncation logic uses boolean decompositions and one-hot
selectors (no witnessed quotients). 1086/1134 columns (supervisor/user).

Includes end-to-end core prove+verify test (raw-instruction program, 3
tiles incl. zero path) and 7 negative soundness tests via
debug_constraints on tampered traces. Regenerates cost/complexity
artifacts; consistency tests pass.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
